From a9dc4eadf91c4d71aef1bf1ebe11b9212327d7e6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sanne de Vries <65487235+sanne-san@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 8 Jun 2026 12:22:27 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Remove the `/team/select` page (#6423)

* Remove the `/team/select` page

- Topbar dropdown now lists all teams (scrolls after ~5 to be sure, though no users have more than 5 teams yet)
- Empty-state "Go to team sites" now has a dropdown button that routes directly instead of via a separate page
- Deleted the route, controller, template, and related tests

* Add changelog entry

* Add moduledoc to RequireAccountPlug

* Refine team switcher dropdown

- Pin active team to the top to ensure it's always visible
- Replace right border with check icon to highlight active team
- Add max width to dropdown menu
